1
00:00:00,636 --> 00:00:02,586
(Susan:)Nice to see you again,
Dr. Hofstadter.

2
00:00:02,588 --> 00:00:04,418
(Stuart:)I'm, uh, Leonard's friend,
Stuart.

3
00:00:04,423 --> 00:00:06,753
(Beverley:)Nice to see you, too.

4
00:00:06,759 --> 00:00:07,979
(Stuart:)Hi, I'm Stuart.

5
00:00:07,977 --> 00:00:10,647
Ooh, I'm Alfred.
Leonard's father.

6
00:00:10,646 --> 00:00:14,266
Oh! Oh, hi. Uh, I'm sorry, did
you two want to sit together?

7
00:00:14,266 --> 00:00:16,236
(Leonard:)No.
No.

8
00:00:17,436 --> 00:00:22,276
(Stuart:)I was wondering why the
front row was available.

9
00:00:22,274 --> 00:00:24,444
(Bernadette:)Okay, I think
we're ready.

10
00:00:32,284 --> 00:00:34,504
(Sheldon:)Why do people
cry at weddings?

11
00:00:34,503 --> 00:00:37,673
(Mary:)They're practicing for
what's coming later.

12
00:00:42,294 --> 00:00:45,214
(Susan:)Thank you for cleaning yourself
up for your sister's wedding.

13
00:00:45,214 --> 00:00:48,554
(Randall:)Thank you for my new teeth.

14
00:00:52,555 --> 00:00:54,225
(Wyatt:)Welcome to the family,
Leonard.

15
00:00:54,223 --> 00:01:01,023
(Wyatt:)Don't lend your new
brother-in-law money.

